'--with-faucet=[Start a faucet with default host and port\: 0.0.0.0\:9123. This flag accepts also a port, a host, or both (e.g., 0.0.0.0\:9123). When providing a specific value, please use the = sign between the flag and value\: \`--with-faucet=6124\` or \`--with-faucet=0.0.0.0\`, or \`--with-faucet=0.0.0.0\:9123\`]' \
